"content"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Tours\/documentation\/Tours","doc:\/\/Tours\/documentation\/Tours\/GraphProtocols","doc:\/\/Tours\/documentation\/Tours\/GraphProtocols\/Graph"]]},"abstract":[{"text":"The nearest-neighbour tour from the first vertex: repeatedly the nearest unvisited vertex,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the first in ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"vertices"},{"text":" order on ties, then back to the start.","type":"text"}],"references":{"doc://GraphProtocols/documentation/GraphProtocols/Graph/Vertex":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"associatedtype"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Vertex"},{"kind":"text","text":" : "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Hashable","preciseIdentifier":"s:SH"}],"role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/graphprotocols\/graph\/vertex","identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/documentation\/GraphProtocols\/Graph\/Vertex","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","title":"Vertex","abstract":[]},"doc://Tours/documentation/Tours/GraphProtocols/Graph":{"url":"\/documentation\/tours\/graphprotocols\/graph","title":"Graph","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"extension"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols0A0P","text":"Graph"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Tours\/documentation\/Tours\/GraphProtocols\/Graph","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","type":"topic","abstract":[],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Graph"}]},"doc://Tours/documentation/Tours/GraphProtocols/Graph/nearestNeighborTour(weight:)":{"url":"\/documentation\/tours\/graphprotocols\/graph\/nearestneighbortour(weight:)","identifier":"doc:\/\/Tours\/documentation\/Tours\/GraphProtocols\/Graph\/nearestNeighborTour(weight:)","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"nearestNeighborTour","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"W","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":">(","kind":"text"},{"text":"weight","ki